        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Oil Rubbed Bronze Kian 60 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in thru-bolt mounting, back to back mounting, and surface mounting, the 60 Inch Kian Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull is easy to install on most doors. This door handle has 60 inch mounting centers and a 60-3/4 inch overall length. We sometimes call the Oil Rubbed Bronze Kian 60 Inch Door Handle the most modern handle because of its sleek design. At 5 feet in length, this front door pull is sure to make a grand statement. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed a different size?  <a href=\"/products/24-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>24 Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/36-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>36\" Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/48-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>48\" Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/72-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>72\" Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rectangular Doorware Designs RTMPULL60-613:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 60-3/4\" (1544mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 60\" (1524mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 1-1/2\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTMPULL60-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262424\"><b>DWD-RTMPULL60 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "60 Inch Kian Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull",
                "description": "Available in thru-bolt mounting, back to back mounting, and surface mounting, the 60 Inch Kian Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull is easy to install on most doors. This door handle has 60 inch mounting centers and a 60-3/4 inch overall length. We sometimes call the Oil Rubbed Bronze Kian 60 Inch Door Handle the most modern handle because of its sleek design. At 5 feet in length, this front door pull is sure to make a grand statement.",
